---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About">
    <main>
        <div class="separador"></div>
        <article>
            <h2 style="color: var(--contrast)"> 
                Innovating Talent Management: The Freelance-Cop Methodology
            </h2>
            <p>
                At our company, we're transforming project development. Our <strong>Freelance-Cop</strong> approach 
                allows us to build highly specialized, on-demand teams by selecting top professionals 
                from our global network of partner freelancers.
            </p>
            <p>
                This methodology enables us to respond with agility and precision to each client's needs, 
                ensuring excellence and flexibility in every deliverable.
            </p>
        </article>
  
        <article>
            <h2 style="color: var(--contrast)">How It Works</h2>
            <ol>
                <li>
                    <strong>Initial Consultation:</strong> We analyze your project's specific requirements.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Talent Selection:</strong> We handpick experts from our freelancer roster based 
                    on the technical, creative, and strategic needs.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Team Assembly:</strong> We form a tailored team, led by a dedicated project manager.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Execution:</strong> We collaborate closely with you to guarantee outstanding results.
                </li>
            </ol>
        </article>
  
        <article >
            <h2 style="color: var(--contrast)">Freelance-Cop Benefits</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>
                    <strong>Flexibility:</strong> Teams scale and adapt to each client's evolving needs.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Specialization:</strong> Access carefully curated, niche talent.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Speed:</strong> We assemble project teams rapidly.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Cost-Effective:</strong> Our lean structure means costs align directly with the project scope.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Guaranteed Quality:</strong> We partner exclusively with pre-vetted, proven freelancers.
                </li>
            </ul>
        </article>
  
        <article>
            <h2 style="color: var(--contrast)">Why Choose Us?</h2>
            <p>
                Because we understand that every client and every project is unique. 
                Our Freelance-Cop methodology isn't just innovative—it delivers effective, 
                personalized, high-quality results.
            </p>
            <p>
                We work <strong>with you, not just for you</strong>, building relationships grounded 
                in trust and measurable outcomes.
            </p>
        </article>
    </main>
</Layout>

<style>
    main {
        height: auto;
        width: 100vw;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: center;
        align-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        padding-bottom: 100px;
        background-color: var(--background);
        color: var(--contrast);
    }
    article {
        width: 90%;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        p,
        h2,
        span {
            text-align: left;
            line-height: 1.5;
            color: black;
            /* margin: 0 5%; */
        }
        li {
            line-height: 1.5;
            color: black;
            margin: 1rem 0;
        }
    }
    .separador{
        min-height: 60vh;
        width: 100%;
        width: 100vw;
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.781);
        background-image: url("/gif/poweranger.gif");
        background-size: contain;
        background-size: 50vw 20vh;
        background-blend-mode:darken;
    }
    @media (min-width: 1280px) {
        main {
        /* height: 100vh; */
        width: 100vw;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: center;
        align-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        padding-bottom: 100px;
        background-color: var(--background);
        color: var(--contrast);
    }
    article {
        width: 90%;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: flex-start;
        p,
        h2,
        span {
            text-align: left;
            line-height: 1.5;
            color: black;
            /* margin: 0 5%; */
        }
        li {
            line-height: 1.5;
            color: black;
            margin: 1rem 0;
        }
    }
    .separador{
        min-height: 60vh;
        width: 100%;
        background-size: 20vw 30vh;
    }
    img {
        height: auto;
        width: 100%;
        display: none;
    }
    }
</style>
